+> STOP. Captain's notes: non-binding. Captain writes, Captain trims. Anyone else: close this file now.
+
+# Captain Notes
+
+Binding behaviour lives in `.feature` specs and referenced `assets/**`. History lives in git. These notes carry only what the next cycle needs.
+
+## Voyage 1 — TodoMVC bootstrap
+
+**Intent:** Build a TodoMVC app per `assets/app-spec.md`, using `assets/app-template.index.html` as base. Vanilla JS, localStorage persistence, no preprocessors.
+
+**Spec sources:**
+- `assets/app-spec.md` — full functional spec (TodoMVC spec)
+- `assets/app-template.index.html` — HTML template to base markup on
+
+**Key constraints from spec:**
+- `index.html` at root, `js/app.js` as entry point, `css/app.css` for style overrides
+- Components: `js/controllers/` and `js/models/` per recommended structure
+- localStorage key: `todos-[framework]` → `todos-javascript`
+- Routing: `#/` (all), `#/active`, `#/completed` via hashchange
+- `@logic` tier tag for all product scenarios (per RIGGING.md: `default: @logic`)
+
+**Implementation files to be created (by Crew/Shipwright):**
+- `index.html` — template based on `assets/app-template.index.html`
+- `js/app.js` — app entry, controller, router, model, view all in one file (vanilla JS)
+- `css/app.css` — minimal style overrides
+- `package.json` — dependencies per spec
+
+**Watchbill:** 13 scenarios across 13 watch objects (one per scenario), all `@logic` tagged.
+
+**Rigging considerations:**
+- `happy-dom` is the verification tier (no real browser needed — all behaviours observable in DOM)
+- `navigate(hash)` helper in world.js drives routing via hashchange
+- `localStorage` available via `this.window.localStorage`
+- `loadApp()` auto-loads index.html + evals js/app.js
+
+**Decisions:**
+- No external dependencies beyond `todomvc-common` and `todomvc-app-css` (per spec)
+- Vanilla JS router using hashchange event (per spec: "use vanilla localStorage" + hash routing)
+- Single `js/app.js` for Voyage 1, refactor into `js/controllers/` and `js/models/` later if needed
\ No newline at end of file
